b = F.band("bO2", "斷網下 sync／build 必成功（Q26）：launcher_started → 快路徑全相符 → 0；有差 → inspect（先本機覆寫 tag、核 image ID）本機有就不 pull → resolve sync → apply|no → 0；否則續（3′）apply sync", v2=True)
